"Project" means a website, app, piece of software, game, document, video, product or other work in which the Icons
are used as part of a larger whole, and are not the main thing being offered.


1. What you may do

Free of charge, worldwide and for as long as you follow this license, you may use, copy, change (including resize and
recolour) and display the Icons in any number of Projects, personal or commercial, including work you do for clients,
and distribute the Icons as part of those Projects.


2. What you may not do

a. Resell or redistribute the Icons on their own. You may not sell, license, give away or publish the Icons, changed
   or not, as icons or as the main value of a product: for example as an icon set, icon pack, icon font, component
   library, design system, UI kit, template, design-asset bundle, or on a marketplace or asset site.

b. Compete with them. You may not include the Icons in a product or service whose purpose is to provide icons,
   illustrations or design assets to others, or that lets others make icons in the same style.

c. Train on them or copy their style. You may not use the Icons to train, fine-tune or evaluate machine-learning
   models, or use them as a source or reference to make other icons, sets or generators that imitate their look.

d. Claim them. You may not present the Icons as your own work, or remove this license from copies of this
   repository or its packages.

e. Use the name. This license does not let you use the name or marks of Antheo to promote anything.


3. Keeping the notice

If you redistribute this repository or its packages' source as allowed above (for example inside a Project's own
source code), keep this license with it. Projects do not need to credit Antheo in their interface, though it is
always welcome.


4. Ending

If you break this license, your rights under it end automatically. They come back if you stop within 30 days of
learning of the breach and it was your first.


5. No warranty

The Icons are provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. Antheo is not liable for any claim, damage or other
liability arising from the Icons or their use.


